Hytale Launcher License Information
-----------------------------------

The Hytale Launcher binary, the "Hytale" trademark, and the included
icon (com.hypixel.HytaleLauncher.png) are the exclusive property of
Hypixel Studios Canada.

This package ("hytale-launcher-bin") provides a community-maintained
wrapper to facilitate the installation and execution of the launcher
on Arch Linux. The icon is provided for the sole purpose of application
identification within the user's desktop environment.

The software contained within the Hytale Launcher is proprietary.
By installing this package, you agree to the Hytale End User License
Agreement (EULA) provided by the developers.

